# Blood Moon enters after Conversion, but Conversion's effect depends on Blood Moon's: applying "Nonbasic lands are
# Mountains" changes what "All Mountains are Plains" applies to (CR 613.8a), so Blood Moon's applies first whatever the
# timestamps (CR 613.8b), and then Conversion's makes those Mountains Plains (CR 305.7). The Taiga, already a Plains, stays
# one; Mutavault, which becomes a Mountain only through Blood Moon after Conversion is out, is a Plains too and taps for
# {W}, not {R}.
[Bot1 Deck]
Taiga
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Conversion
Blood Moon
Mutavault
Plains x15
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30
